  "historyNote": "#9774-A, eff 8-26-10 (from Puc 2002.07); ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17 (from Puc 2002.05); ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.08)",
